        "Due to confidentiality, the following industries have been revised from 2017Q1 and are now reported with “..”  05 coal and lingite mines 06 crude petroleum and natural gas extraction industry 07 metal ore mines 08 other mines quarries 09 service companies incidental to mining support service activities",
        "In connection with the publication of the first quarter 2020, the method for conversion from acquisition value to replacement value has been amended. The revised method has been used to calculate changes in inventories as from the second quarter 2019, and therefore, these statistics have been revised."
